== cli
$ cxp teams workflow enable --webhook-url-file <root>/home/.config/cxp-e2e-workflow/webhook-url
   exit 0
   stdout| Teams workflow notifications enabled.
   stdout| Webhook URL file: configured (ok)
   stdout| The running Teams helper applied the change.
$ cxp teams workflow disable
   exit 0
   stdout| Teams workflow notifications disabled.
   stdout| The running Teams helper applied the change.
